                                                "sense_id": "5b22d77a-fddc-3298-8684-3db18c30ce71",
                                                "text": "They walked by a tea museum, two local pharmacies, a bakery, and one hole-in-the-wall shop still selling knickknacks from Chinese New Year, before coming to a stop outside the unassuming front door of 189."
                                            }
